// touching the sentinel operands ir_rows leaves undefined (its "add" is
// never read by ll_val, only stored and reread by the core/ cases it
// serves): ir_fix2's add instruction (id 2) has two real, safe operands,
// so it is put in a real block of a real function here instead.
ll_blk_fixture() {
  ir_fix2();
